  scientist  are jupiter notebook spyder  pycharm and rstudio so some of the  additional skills that you might require  to become a data scientist  are these knowledge of data edl tools  there is  data extraction data transformation and  data loading  a data scientist has multiple data  sources such as  mysql mongodb google analytics and many  more  so data scientists have to extract data  from such  sources and then transform it for  storing it in a proper format  or structure for the purposes of  querying an analysis  so having a fundamental knowledge of edl  tools is always  important so followed by that the next  important skill is the data  visualization tools like  tableau and power bi results that cannot  express  are considered ineffective hence  using some top-notch data visualization  tools like tableau  and power bi is really important for a  data scientist  followed by that we have communication  skills so communication skills are  really important to understand your  client requirement  and help him with the right data which  he needs  so finally the big data frameworks most  of the organizations are using big data  analytics to gain hidden business  insights  it is therefore a must-have skill for  data scientists  so with this we will move ahead into the  next type of developer  which is the big data developer  so what exactly is a big data developer  so  big data developer is the one who writes  software programs to store and retrieve  vast amounts of data and systems such as  data warehouses  relational databases data lake  management systems etc  using the most crucial tools which are  the extract  transform and load so  some of the major programming languages  and the frameworks that you might  require to become a big data developer  are scalar programming language  our programming language java most  importantly and next is the python  so the major frameworks that you might  require to become a big data developer  are  joby the notebook spider pycharm  and apache spark so apache spark  is a processing layer similar to  mapreduce  so this is the fastest processing layer  compared to mapreduce so i prefer you to  learn the basic terminologies and the  components of  hadoop along with apache spark  processing layer  so followed by this we shall also learn  some additional skills required to  become a big data developer  so the additional skills include to be  capable enough to design  build install configure and support the  hadoop system  working on desperate data sets create  scalable and  high-performance web services for  tracking data maintain security and data  privacy  so for hadoop we have kerberos for  security and data privacy  and finally high speed querying so high  speed querying can be done by framework  such as  hive edge base etc so finally  we will enter into the last type of  developer in today's session  which is the cyber security developer  so who exactly is a cyber security  developer  so the cyber security developer  specializes in creating systems methods  and procedures  to test the security of software system  and exploit and fix the security flaws  so this type of developer often works as  a white hat  ethical hacker and attempts to penetrate  systems to discover  their vulnerabilities so the major  programming languages and frameworks  that a cyber security developer must  know are python javascript and php  also the important frameworks that the  cyber security developer must  know are information security management  systems  cis controls and nist csf  adding on to that the important  additional skills that a cyber security  developer must  know are the fundamentals of hacking to  be a cyber security developer you need  to think like a hacker to fully  understand  how a system could be breached and in  turn creative effective solutions  to stop these attacks from penetrating  into your system  followed by that the next important  skill is to have a fundamental knowledge  of computer forensics  so what if your efforts fail and your  confidential data gets recovered  even after you destroy every single clue  of it  while computer forensics and cyber  security are two separate fields  they actually are closely related so  having a foundation on  computer forensics can help you excel  your cyber security career  followed by that the next important  skill is to pay attention to  every single detail so being confident  is good  but being ready is not a crime being a  cyber security developer  you will be responsible for continuous  network monitoring and  will need to be able to quickly identify  concerns and  come up with real-time security  solutions to address them  so why do you give some attention to  every single detail  and be ready for the next potential  threat  so the last additional skill is  fundamentals of cross-platform security  cyber security isn't just limited to  computers you'll need to be comfortable  working on variety of operating systems  computer systems mobile devices cloud  networks and  wireless networks and to keep up to date  on advances in the field of all of them  so with this we have come to an end of  this session on how to become a software  developer if you have any queries  regarding this session or  should you think that we missed out any  specific type of developer  or if you have any suggestions for us  then please feel free to drop them down  in the comment section below  so this is ravi signing off and thank  you  until next time  hi there if you like this video  subscribe to the simply learn youtube  channel  and click here to watch similar videos  turn it up and get certified  click here
 

